<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY UNION-ACT BEAT WAIKATO 48-34 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ACT BEAT WAIKATO 48-34 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Capital Territory</p>
<p>(ACT) beat Waikato 48-34 (halftime 29-13) in a Super 12 series</p>
<p>rugby union match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>ACT - Tries: Joe Roff (2), Troy Coker, Owen Finegan, George</p>
<p>Gregan, Mitch Hardy, Stephen Larkhan. Conversions: David Knox 5.</p>
<p>Penalties: Knox 1.</p>
<p>Waikato - Tries: Eric Rush (3), Aaron Hopa. Conversions: Ian</p>
<p>Foster 4. Penalties: Matt Cooper 2.</p>
</text>
